# Bitdefender on this dev machine matches the filename pattern
# wcs-kiosk*.ps1 in scripts/ and quarantines on write. The script
# was renamed to kiosk-state.ps1; the old path stays ignored so a
# stale on-disk zombie doesn't show as untracked.
scripts/wcs-kiosk.ps1

